    "final_answer": "I have successfully gathered all the information needed. Let me provide the final answer.\n\n## Final Answer\n\n### Billboard No. 1 Weekly Charts Ranked Artist\n**Morgan Wallen** is the No. 1 ranked artist on the Billboard Artist 100 weekly charts, with an impressive **40 weeks at No. 1** and **393 weeks on chart** (current as of the most recent chart).\n\n### Top 10 Most Played Songs by Morgan Wallen (based on Spotify streams via Kworb.net)\n\n| Rank | Song Title | Total Streams |\n|------|------------|---------------|\n| 1 | **I Had Some Help** (feat. Morgan Wallen) — Post Malone | 1,604,322,574 |\n| 2 | **Last Night** | 1,563,682,227 |\n| 3 | **Whiskey Glasses** | 1,213,333,474 |\n| 4 | **Wasted On You** | 1,023,049,630 |\n| 5 | **You Proof** | 986,308,451 |\n| 6 | **Chasin' You** | 972,212,780 |\n| 7 | **Thinkin' Bout Me** | 841,291,267 |\n| 8 | **Cowgirls** (with ERNEST) | 825,987,021 |\n| 9 | **Heartless** (feat. Morgan Wallen) — The Weeknd | 797,439,586 |\n| 10 | **More Than My Hometown** | 794,937,737 |\n\n**Notes:**\n- The list includes both songs where Morgan Wallen is the lead artist and songs where he appears as a featured artist.\n- Combined, he has over **32.3 billion total streams** across 159 tracks on Spotify.\n- All rankings are based on cumulative lifetime Spotify stream counts (data last updated 2026/09/25 from Kworb.net).",
